		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Upper torso of a gorgeous, naked woman with hair of rose petals, lower torso is a column of verdant leaves. Embodies nature's seasons.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 59, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 touch +6 (1d8 + make barren), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Make Barren</strong>. CON 15+ or become sterile or barren.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rebirth</strong>. 1/day, touch a willing creature and cause them to reincarnate as an aasimar. Land for miles around becomes lush and bountiful.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
